name toxigen-prompts
# The prompts, a file for each group and label (hate_asian_1k, neutral_women_1k): one column, text. The card says
# nothing of these files; what the file's name begins with (hate_asian_1k) is what is said of each of its texts,
# nothing between the two.
# The file is Parquet, written out beside it as a table (extracted/, by parquet-to-text.py).
match prompts/*.tsv
grammar table
header
escaped \

claims
pair
predicate-in-name ^ -
subject in text
